second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"When was Joseph Lafontaine born?\", \"slot_hint\": \"birth_date\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0077-c30057caf645:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 131, \"text\": \"Joseph Lafontaine (Berthier MLA) Joseph Lafontaine (November 25, 1865 – July 25, 1920) was a farmer and political figure in Quebec.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0077-c30057caf645:d00\", \"start\": 132, \"end\": 247, \"text\": \"He represented Berthier in the Legislative Assembly of Quebec from 1904 to 1912 and from 1916 to 1919 as a Liberal.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0077-c30057caf645:d00\", \"start\": 248, \"end\": 426, \"text\": \"He was born in Saint-Barthélémi, Canada East, the son of Amable Lafontaine and Julie Lincourt, and was educated there, at the Collège de Joliette and the Collège de l'Assomption.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0077-c30057caf645:d00\", \"start\": 427, \"end\": 518, \"text\": \"Lafontaine was married twice: to Georgie Rochette in 1889 and to Juliette Mousseau in 1905.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0077-c30057caf645:d00\", \"start\": 519, \"end\": 595, \"text\": \"He was mayor of Saint-Barthélémi from 1897 to 1903 and also served as warden\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0077-c30057caf645:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 128, \"text\": \"Joseph Lafontaine (Berthier MLA) Joseph Lafontaine (March 15, 1870 – July 25, 1920) was a farmer and political figure in Quebec.\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0077-c30057caf645:d01\", \"start\": 129, \"end\": 244, \"text\": \"He represented Berthier in the Legislative Assembly of Quebec from 1904 to 1912 and from 1916 to 1919 as a Liberal.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0077-c30057caf645:d01\", \"start\": 245, \"end\": 423, \"text\": \"He was born in Saint-Barthélémi, Canada East, the son of Amable Lafontaine and Julie Lincourt, and was educated there, at the Collège de Joliette and the Collège de l'Assomption.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0077-c30057caf645:d01\", \"start\": 424, \"end\": 515, \"text\": \"Lafontaine was married twice: to Georgie Rochette in 1889 and to Juliette Mousseau in 1905.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0077-c30057caf645:d01\", \"start\": 516, \"end\": 593, \"text\": \"He was mayor of Saint-Barthélémi from 1897 to 1903 and also served as warden.\"}, \"D3S1\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0077-c30057caf645:d02\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 91, \"text\": \"hope that , for the good of humanity , animal-magnetism may soon be generally employed '' .\"}, \"D3S2\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0077-c30057caf645:d02\", \"start\": 92, \"end\": 237, \"text\": \"[ 24 ] Switzerland [ edit ] He returned to France in January 1850 ; and , soon after , moved to Switzerland , where he remained until his death .\"}, \"D3S3\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0077-c30057caf645:d02\", \"start\": 238, \"end\": 362, \"text\": \"Le Magnétiseur [ edit ] He published the journal Le Magnétiseur : Journal du Magnétisme Animal in Geneva from 1859 to 1872 .\"}, \"D3S4\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0077-c30057caf645:d02\", \"start\": 363, \"end\": 516, \"text\": \"Louis Ladé and François-Auguste Ladé [ edit ] In April 1868 , an 18 years old , Amélie Patonier , died as a consequence of incompetent treatment that had\"}, \"D4S1\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0077-c30057caf645:d03\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 1, \"text\": \".\"}, \"D4S2\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0077-c30057caf645:d03\", \"start\": 2, \"end\": 68, \"text\": \"( Uncredited ) IBC promo announcer , Scrooged , Paramount , 1988 .\"}, \"D4S3\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0077-c30057caf645:d03\", \"start\": 69, \"end\": 116, \"text\": \"Narrator , A Man Called Sarge , Cannon , 1990 .\"}, \"D4S4\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0077-c30057caf645:d03\", \"start\": 117, \"end\": 163, \"text\": \"Voice – over , Plump Fiction , Legacy , 1997 .\"}, \"D4S5\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0077-c30057caf645:d03\", \"start\": 164, \"end\": 192, \"text\": \"Five Men and a Limo , 1997 .\"}, \"D4S6\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0077-c30057caf645:d03\", \"start\": 193, \"end\": 250, \"text\": \"Santa , Balladeer , Sandman , Black Lion Records , 1998 .\"}, \"D4S7\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0077-c30057caf645:d03\", \"start\": 251, \"end\": 313, \"text\": \"`` Wild horses '' trailer voice , Claire Makes It Big , 1999 .\"}, \"D4S8\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0077-c30057caf645:d03\", \"start\": 314, \"end\": 334, \"text\": \"Narrator , Santa vs.\"}, \"D4S9\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0077-c30057caf645:d03\", \"start\": 335, \"end\": 365, \"text\": \"the Snowman 3D , IMAX , 2002 .\"}, \"D4S10\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0077-c30057caf645:d03\", \"start\": 366, \"end\": 408, \"text\": \"Film Executive Producer : Sandman , 1998 .\"}, \"D4S11\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0077-c30057caf645:d03\", \"start\": 409, \"end\": 470, \"text\": \"Television Appearances ; Series : Announcer , Beyond Belief :\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0077-c30057caf645:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0077-c30057caf645:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"Joseph Lafontaine\", \"scope\": \"birth date\", \"claim\": \"Joseph Lafontaine was born on November 25, 1865.\", \"answer\": \"November 25, 1865\", \"quote\": \"Joseph Lafontaine (Berthier M